        "id": 184982,
        "name": "Jeysie",
        "username": "Jeysie",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-11-19T22:23:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm right-handed myself but had a few lefties in my various music classes claim it was kind of awkward learning to play some instruments.</p><p>On the realm of funny instruments, I think there should be at least one Virtuoso who played the recorder because I'm pretty sure you NEED magic powers to play that idiot thing properly. (Seriously, every single blasted music teacher I had taught the recorder at some point (whyyyyyyyy), and it was always lucky if one person out of the class could manage to make it sound right.)</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
