        "created_at": "2016-11-19T22:37:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I once saw a quartet (Red Priest) with a real life recorder virtuoso - Piers Adams. What he could do with a recorder blew my mind.</p><p>http://www.piersadams.com/concertos/</p>",
