      {
        "id": 184984,
        "name": "Jeysie",
        "username": "Jeysie",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-11-19T23:11:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Holy [bleep], I think I'm in love. Yeah, I'm positive there is magic powers involved there. :D Especially since the guy apparently used to be an astrophysicist, which was already cool enough if you ask me, but then he apparently decided his true calling in life was to play the recorder like a boss, because wow.</p><p>Thank you for that link, I love new music stuff to listen to I hadn't known of before! Especially an instrument I never before realized could actually <em>not</em> sound terrible.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
