        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-11-25T21:42:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/grysqrl\">@grysqrl</a>: As a barbershop singing fangirl, I approve of kazoos and slide whistles.</p>\n<p>And as a mad scientist fangirl, I approve of theremins. Doesn't Baron Blade's villain theme have a theremin in it?</p>\n<p>Also:</p>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"McBehrer\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/48/1850_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> McBehrer:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Phantom5613\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantom5613/48/1906_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Phantom5613:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I want a promo card of 'Weird Al, Virtuoso of the Void' now.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>All of my YES</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>",
